lass=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precise control and team coordination required</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/f8ecdcae5004d3c9cafbb28ed5b0fd94.poster.avif?t=1754052367\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/f8ecdcae5004d3c9cafbb28ed5b0fd94.webm?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/f8ecdcae5004d3c9cafbb28ed5b0fd94.mp4?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Obstacles and Puzzles</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steep hills, narrow passages, and dangerous bridges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level demands new strategies and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect timing and teamwork are essential</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/5b63adf0bcf14e91065693f00ce21ad7.poster.avif?t=1754052367\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/5b63adf0bcf14e91065693f00ce21ad7.webm?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/5b63adf0bcf14e91065693f00ce21ad7.mp4?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cooperative Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop strategies together with your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone's role is critical - success is impossible alone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local and online multiplayer support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/375d1d017628acf7c22374f74d5690b8.poster.avif?t=1754052367\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/375d1d017628acf7c22374f74d5690b8.webm?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/375d1d017628acf7c22374f74d5690b8.mp4?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you and your team endure to the end in this nerve-testing, patience-demanding, yet incredibly satisfying experience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/149ad5b6b8e8beab32d8658fe7dc701b.poster.avif?t=1754052367\" width=600 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/149ad5b6b8e8beab32d8658fe7dc701b.webm?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3877380/extras/149ad5b6b8e8beab32d8658fe7dc701b.mp4?t=1754052367\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
